[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0010","text":"好～的\n那么，我们一起来画画吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0011","text":"孩子们"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0020","text":"好～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0030","text":"嗯嗯\n画得真棒～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0040","text":"呐呐，这是在画什么呀～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0050","text":"不知道想画什么？\n那，画我好不好～？可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0060","text":"大家—\n最后，对着镜头展示一下你们的画哦—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0061","text":"阳希&孩子们"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0070","text":"画好啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0080","text":"哈哈，画画大姐姐\n完全沉浸其中了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0081","text":"阳希"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0090","text":"呵呵，是吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32800200_02_0100","text":"制作人也一起来就好了呀……！"}]
